# Project Structure Guide

## Project Overview
Buddhist Scripture Reader (般若佛经阅读器) - A Zen-inspired reading platform built with Vue 3 + Vite + Vant.

## Key Entry Points
- **Main Application**: [src/main.js](mdc:src/main.js) - Application entry point
- **Root Component**: [src/App.vue](mdc:src/App.vue) - Root Vue component
- **Router**: [src/router/index.js](mdc:src/router/index.js) - Route definitions
- **Data Files**: 
  - [src/data/sutras.js](mdc:src/data/sutras.js) - Scripture data (3-5 classics for MVP)
  - [src/data/dictionary.js](mdc:src/data/dictionary.js) - Buddhist terms dictionary (100+ terms)
  - [src/data/pronunciation-map.js](mdc:src/data/pronunciation-map.js) - Multi-tone character mapping

## Core Components
- **BookCard**: [src/components/BookCard.vue](mdc:src/components/BookCard.vue) - Sutra card for bookshelf
- **ReaderContent**: [src/components/ReaderContent.vue](mdc:src/components/ReaderContent.vue) - Reading content display
- **DictionaryPopup**: [src/components/DictionaryPopup.vue](mdc:src/components/DictionaryPopup.vue) - Multi-terminal dictionary popup (mobile drawer / tablet tooltip / PC sidebar)
- **AudioPlayer**: [src/components/AudioPlayer.vue](mdc:src/components/AudioPlayer.vue) - TTS audio controls
- **ThemeToggle**: [src/components/ThemeToggle.vue](mdc:src/components/ThemeToggle.vue) - Theme switcher

## Page Components
- **Bookshelf**: [src/pages/Bookshelf.vue](mdc:src/pages/Bookshelf.vue) - Bookshelf page with grid layout
- **Reader**: [src/pages/Reader.vue](mdc:src/pages/Reader.vue) - Reader page (core feature)
- **Settings**: [src/pages/Settings.vue](mdc:src/pages/Settings.vue) - Settings page

## State Management (Pinia)
- **Settings Store**: [src/stores/settings.js](mdc:src/stores/settings.js) - User preferences (font size, theme, TTS speed, pronunciation toggle)
- **Progress Store**: [src/stores/progress.js](mdc:src/stores/progress.js) - Reading progress persistence
- **Theme Store**: [src/stores/theme.js](mdc:src/stores/theme.js) - Theme state (day/night mode)

## Core Utilities
- **Trie Tree**: [src/utils/trie.js](mdc:src/utils/trie.js) - Dictionary matching algorithm (buildTrie, findMatches, removeOverlaps)
- **TTS Engine**: [src/utils/tts.js](mdc:src/utils/tts.js) - Web Speech API wrapper (TTSEngine class)
- **Pronunciation**: [src/utils/pronunciation.js](mdc:src/utils/pronunciation.js) - Buddhist pronunciation mapping and annotation
- **Storage**: [src/utils/storage.js](mdc:src/utils/storage.js) - localStorage helpers

## Styles
- **Variables**: [src/assets/styles/variables.scss](mdc:src/assets/styles/variables.scss) - SCSS variables (colors, fonts, spacing)
- **Reset**: [src/assets/styles/reset.scss](mdc:src/assets/styles/reset.scss) - Global reset
- **Global**: [src/assets/styles/global.scss](mdc:src/assets/styles/global.scss) - Global styles with mixins

